RSI LEVEL 3: AUTO-GENERATION RESULTS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PURPOSE: Document the implementation and results of RSI Level 3
(Auto-Generation) for creating new components based on patterns.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
PART 1: IMPLEMENTATION
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1.1 COMPONENTS IMPLEMENTED
──────────────────────────────────────
✓ rsi_pattern_detector.py — Pattern detection
  - Detect recurring misclassifications
  - Identify threshold clustering
  - Find latency spikes
  - Detect coverage gaps

✓ rsi_predicate_generator.py — Predicate generation
  - Generate new predicates
  - Create edge case handlers
  - Build optimized predicates
  - Register in system

✓ rsi_advanced_tree_generator.py — Advanced tree generation
  - Generate advanced trees
  - Create trees with multiple branches
  - Build trees with predicates
  - Register in system

✓ rsi_component_registry.py — Component registration
  - Register all generated components
  - Validate component syntax
  - Activate/deactivate components
  - Track component performance

✓ test_rsi_level3.py — Test harness
  - Generate diverse data
  - Detect patterns
  - Generate predicates
  - Generate trees
  - Register components

1.2 ARCHITECTURE
──────────────────────────────────────
  Input: Classification data
    ↓
  Detect Patterns (rsi_pattern_detector.py)
    ↓
  Analyze Patterns (identify generation type)
    ↓
  Generate Predicate (rsi_predicate_generator.py)
    ↓
  Generate Tree (rsi_advanced_tree_generator.py)
    ↓
  Validate Components (syntax check)
    ↓
  Register Components (rsi_component_registry.py)
    ↓
  Output: New components ready for use

